    "title": "Annual Lighting of the Nativity on Courthouse Square - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Macaroni KID Acadia-St. Landry ,\n1 days ago Opelousas Main Street Hosts Annual Lighting of the Nativity on the Courthouse Square November 29th. The holiday season returns with a beloved tradition as Opelousas Main Street, Inc. presents the Lighting of the Nativity on Saturday, November 29, 2025, continuing a legacy that has brightened downtown Opelousas for more than 70 years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
